{"id":10047,"name":"heracross-mega","speciesId":214,"dex":214,"form":"mega","generation":2,"types":["bug","fighting"],"stats":{"hp":80,"attack":185,"defense":115,"special-attack":40,"special-defense":105,"speed":75},"abilities":[{"name":"skill-link","hidden":false}],"height":17,"weight":625,"baseExp":210,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10047.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/10047.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/10047.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/10047.ogg","genus":"Single Horn Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"soulsilver","text":"It is usually docile, but if it is disturbed while sipping honey, it chases off the intruder with its horn."},{"version":"gold","text":"This powerful POKéMON thrusts its prized horn under its enemies’ bellies then lifts and throws them."},{"version":"silver","text":"Usually docile, but if disturbed while sipping honey, it chases off the intruder with its horn."},{"version":"crystal","text":"With its Herculean powers, it can easily throw arou­ nd an object that is 100 times its own weight."},{"version":"ruby","text":"HERACROSS charges in a straight line at its foe, slips beneath the foe’s grasp, and then scoops up and hurls the opponent with its mighty horn. This POKéMON even has enough power to topple a massive tree."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"HERACROSS has sharp claws on its feet. These are planted firmly into the ground or the bark of a tree, giving the POKéMON a secure and solid footing to forcefully fling away foes with its proud horn."},{"version":"emerald","text":"They gather in forests seeking the sweet sap of trees. It is completely clad in a steel-hard shell. It is proud of its horn, which it uses to fling foes."},{"version":"leafgreen","text":"This powerful POKéMON thrusts its prized horn under its enemies’ bellies, then lifts and throws them."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It gathers in forests to search for tree sap, its favorite food. It’s strong enough to hurl foes."},{"version":"pearl","text":"With powerful legs and claws, it generates enough power to hurl foes over great distances."},{"version":"platinum","text":"It loves sweet honey. To keep all the honey to itself, it hurls rivals away with its prized horn."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"This powerful Pokémon thrusts its prized horn under its enemies’ bellies, then lifts and throws them."},{"version":"black-2","text":"No matter how heavy its opponents, it flings them far away with its prized horn."},{"version":"y","text":"With its Herculean powers, it can easily throw around an object that is 100 times its own weight."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Heracross charges in a straight line at its foe, slips beneath the foe’s grasp, and then scoops up and hurls the opponent with its mighty horn. This Pokémon even has enough power to topple a massive tree."},{"version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Heracross has sharp claws on its feet. These are planted firmly into the ground or the bark of a tree, giving the Pokémon a secure and solid footing to forcefully fling away foes with its proud horn."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It’s proud of its thick horn. In Alola, its biggest rival is Vikavolt, which it’s always fighting with."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It roams through forests searching for sweet nectar. Although it boasts fantastic physical strength, it’s not that good at flying."},{"version":"sword","text":"Heracross loves sweet sap and will go looking through forests for it. The Pokémon uses its two antennae to pick up scents as it searches."},{"version":"shield","text":"This Pokémon takes pride in its strength, which allows it to lift things 100 times heavier than itself with no trouble at all."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"This Pokémon has an unparalleled horn. Heracross itself demonstrates tremendous power—it's capable of throwing several people trained in the traditional arts of war at once."}],"genderRate":4,"captureRate":45,"eggGroups":["bug"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"heracross","speciesId":214,"evolvesTo":[]},"varieties":[{"id":214,"name":"heracross","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/214.png"},{"id":10047,"name":"heracross-mega","form":"mega","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10047.png"}],"games":[15,16,17,18],"moves":[{"id":14,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0]]},{"id":15,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0]]},{"id":30,"learn":[[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1]]},{"id":31,"learn":[[15,"lv",7],[16,"lv",25],[17,"lv",25],[18,"lv",25]]},{"id":33,"learn":[[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1]]},{"id":36,"learn":[[15,"lv",28],[16,"lv",34],[17,"lv",34],[18,"lv",34]]},{"id":38,"learn":[[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0]]},{"id":42,"learn":[[15,"lv",31],[16,"lv",31],[17,"lv",31],[18,"lv",31]]},{"id":43,"learn":[[15,"lv",1],[16,"lv",1],[17,"lv",1],[18,"lv",1]]},{"id":63,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0]]},{"id":67,"learn":[[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0]]},{"id":68,"learn":[[15,"lv",19],[16,"lv",19],[17,"lv",19],[18,"lv",19]]},{"id":69,"learn":[[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0]]},{"id":70,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0]]},{"id":89,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0]]},{"id":91,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0]]},{"id":92,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0]]},{"id":104,"learn":[[15,"tm",0],[16,"tm",0],[17,"tm",0],[18,"tm",0]]},{"id":106,"learn":[[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0]]},{"id":117,"learn":[[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0]]},{"id"